  "job_B8.4.3.3_20251003_114855": {
    "chunk_text": "synfullum \u00fee d\u00e6dbote de\u00f0. He cw\u00e6\u00f0, so\u00f0lice sum man h\u00e6fde twegen suna. \u00dea cw\u00e6\u00f0 se yldra to his f\u00e6der, F\u00e6der, syle me minne d\u00e6l minre \u00e6hte \u00fee me to gebyre\u00fe; \u00fea d\u00e6lde he \u00d0a \u00e6fter feawa dagum ealle his \u00feing gegaderude se gingra sunu, & ferde wr\u00e6clice on feorlen rice, & \u00d0a he hig h\u00e6fde ealle amyrrede \u00fea wear\u00f0 mycel hunger on \u00feam rice & he wear\u00f0 w\u00e6dla. \u00dea ferde he & folgude anum burhsittendan men \u00fe\u00e6s rices, \u00f0a sende he hine to his tune \u00fe\u00e6t he heolde \u00d0a gewilnode he his wambe gefyllan of \u00feam biencoddun \u00fee \u00f0a swyn \u00e6ton, & him man ne sealde. \u00dea be\u00feohte he hine & cw\u00e6\u00f0, Eala, hu fela yr\u00f0linga on mines f\u00e6der huse hlaf genohne habba\u00f0 & ic Ic arise, & ic fare to minum f\u00e6der, & ic secge him, Eala f\u00e6der, ic syngode on heofenas & beforan Nu ic neom wyr\u00f0e \u00fe\u00e6t ic beo \u00fein sunu nemned; do me swa anne of \u00feinum yr\u00f0lingum. & he aras \u00fea & com to his f\u00e6der, & \u00fea gyt \u00fea he w\u00e6s feorr his f\u00e6der he hyne geseah & wear\u00f0 mid \u00d0a cw\u00e6\u00f0 his sunu, F\u00e6der, ic syngude on heofon, & beforan \u00f0e; Nu ic ne eom wyr\u00fee \u00fe\u00e6t ic \u00fein sunu \u00d0a cw\u00e6\u00fe se f\u00e6der to his \u00feeowum, Bringa\u00f0 ra\u00f0e \u00fe\u00e6ne selestan gegyrelan & scryda\u00f0 hyne & sylla\u00f0 & bringa\u00f0 an f\u00e6tt styric",
